  "plain_language": "In 24 additional continuations, a change to recorded stream 5 did not require continued updating to retain a distinctive way of reading: mean local persistence was 0.212 with frozen habit and schema, versus 0.179 with learning. Schema prediction fit relative to predicting no pull was 0.626 versus 0.866. This includes the steady component, not just changing attention. These are six matched lives and one previously recorded alternate stream; the result is not a general claim about adaptation to arbitrary new worlds.",
